SUMMARY:Mystic Picnic! in-person\, Raleigh area\, last Saturdays
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nDo you enjoy spiri
 tual growth? Are you having amazing experiences that you can’t talk abou
 t with most people? Join the club at the Mystic Picnics at Lake Crabtree p
 ark in Morrisville NC.\n\nEvery last Saturday at the Mystic Picnic from Ma
 rch to October\, we create a safe fun outdoor space for meeting kindred so
 uls and clarifying the concepts that set us free in these ascension times 
 when the realities are so clearly diverging. Which parallel Earth are you 
 from\, and what are you here to do?\n\nWe share stories and support energy
  healing\, psychic gifts\, angels\, nature spirits\, ET helpers\, reincarn
 ation\, lucid dreams\, and so much more. We keep it real\, grounded\, posi
 tive\, and heart-centered\, so folks can bring their genuine concerns with
 out the big conspiracies. I’ve experienced so many wonders myself\, so I
 ’ll be hosting a main circle for friendly discussions. There will be pot
 luck food and a nice grassy field for activities.\n\nBring a chair if you 
 have\, plus food or drink you want to share. I’ll supply cups\, plates\,
  napkins and utensils\, plus extra chairs and snacks. We meet at Lake Crab
 tree park off Route 40 between Durham and Raleigh\, NC. Enter park from Av
 iation Parkway\, proceed to first parking lot on right. If lot is full\, d
 rive to the next lot and walk back\, or wait as people come and go frequen
 tly. You’ll see me with some chairs near the lot (I’ll get the best sp
 ot available)\n\nRAIN LOCATION: If significant rain we meet a half mile no
 rth\, across highway 40 to the RDU Galleria on the right. They have a big 
 food court with outdoor covered seating area. Bring less stuff then\, we m
 ostly have to buy their food.\n\nRe-member. You matter. Time and space are
  rituals. You decide your own future. Your imagination is the doorway. You
 r consciousness creates your own reality.\n\n"I was alive and I waited for
  this. Right here\, right now\, there is no other place I wanna be. Watchi
 ng the world wake up from history."\n\\-\\- Jesus Jones video: [https://ww
 w.youtube.com/watch?v=GNJpLU8qcx8](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNJpLU8
 qcx8)\n\n"There's a starman waiting in the sky. He's told us not to blow i
 t 'cause he knows it's all worthwhile."\n\\-\\- astral David Bowie saves t
 he world in January's stunning 10 year tribute video: [https://www.youtube
 .com/watch?v=ZcC0QWsfpAQ](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZcC0QWsfpAQ)\n\n
 My name is Carl and I’m cross-posting this event in several meetups for 
 maximum networking fun. To see our spiritual meetup events [www.meetup.com
 /inner-selves-for-outer-mastery/](http://www.meetup.com/inner-selves-for-o
 uter-mastery/) YouTube channel [https://www.youtube.com/@InnerSelvesMaster
 y](https://www.youtube.com/@InnerSelvesMastery) and newsletter [www.Signup
 ISM.com](http://www.SignupISM.com) Everyone is welcome to also join and po
 st their own spiritual community events at [https://www.meetup.com/starsee
 dsofraleigh/](https://www.meetup.com/starseedsofraleigh/)\n\nbest wishes\,
 \nCarl Johann Schroeder\nSpiritual Teaching and Life Coaching\n[www.InnerS
 elvesMastery.com](http://www.InnerSelvesMastery.com)\nquick links: [www.Si
 gnupISM.com](http://www.SignupISM.com)
