SUMMARY:Dinner at Anthony's La Piazza 
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nDinner at Anthony
 ’s La Piazza\n\nFriday October 2nd\, 6pm\n\nAnthony’s La Piazza\, 7277
  Veterans Pkwy\, Raleigh\, NC 27603 (919) 662 5007\n[https://anthonyslapia
 zza.net/](https://anthonyslapiazza.net/)\n\nLet’s start the weekend with
  a delicious dinner from Anthony's La Piazza! Anthony’s La Piazza is a b
 eloved Italian dining establishment known for its warm and inviting atmosp
 here. Specializing in traditional Italian cuisine\, the restaurant offers 
 a diverse menu featuring classic dishes such as handcrafted pasta\, wood-f
 ired pizzas\, and expertly prepared seafood and meats. We can enjoy authen
 tic flavors made with fresh\, high-quality ingredients\, paired with an im
 pressive selection of wines to complement every meal. With its cozy ambian
 ce\, attentive service\, and charming decor\, Anthony's La Piazza provides
  a delightful experience perfect for fun dinners and casual dining.\n\nOrg
 anizer: Dwen Andrews [dwencita@gmail.com](mailto:dwencita@gmail.com) 919 6
 24 0762 / 919 244 2710 LE2618
