SUMMARY: Beginner Square Dance Party – No Partner Needed!
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n**Try Something Ne
 w\, Something Fun! Attend the Square Dance Party!**\nEver thought *“I wa
 nt to try something new\, something fun”*? Square dancing in Raleigh is 
 social\, active\, and surprisingly easy — even if you’ve never danced 
 before.\n\nJoin **Capital Squares** for **a square dance party night** on 
 **Tuesday\, October 6\, 2026**\, and discover the fun! Reserve your spot o
 n the dance floor - [https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1996313704028](https://w
 ww.eventbrite.com/e/1996313704028)\n\n🕺 **What to Expect**\n\n* Beginne
 r-friendly instruction — **no experience needed**\n* Gentle\, fun moveme
 nt that keeps your brain and body engaged\n* Friendly\, welcoming group 
 — no partner required\n* Plenty of laughs and small victories\n* Dancing
  to a variety of familiar music styles\n* Meet new friends — people from
  all walks of life come to dance.\n\n👥 **Who This Is Perfect For**\n\n*
  Absolute beginners curious about square dancing\n* Anyone seeking a socia
 l\, low-pressure activity\n* People looking for a fresh\, fun hobby\n* Sol
 o attendees — most people come alone\n\n🤍 **For Nervous First-Timers*
 *\nYou **don’t need to be coordinated or confident**. The first night is
  low-pressure\, paced for beginners\, and designed to be fun from the star
 t. Many who felt nervous walked out smiling — ready for the next week.\n
 \n💬 **What First-Timers Say**\n*"I thought I’d feel awkward\, but I l
 aughed the whole time and actually learned something!"*\n*"I came alone\, 
 but everyone was so friendly — I can’t wait for the next week."*\n\n
 📅 **Event Details**\n\n* **Date:** Tuesday\, October 6\, 2026\n* **Time
 :** 7–9 PM\n* **Location:** St. James United Methodist Church\n* **Cost:
 ** $10 for a night of fun and entertainment\n* **Purchase advance tickets*
 * Here: [https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1996313704028](https://www.eventbrit
 e.com/e/1996313704028)\n\n🎶 **Bonus:** This party night is a perfect pr
 eview of our **12-week beginner lesson series starting October 13th\, 2026
 **.\n\n⚠️ **Only 40 spots for new dancers!** 👉 **[Grab your spot no
 w!](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1996313704028)**\nGrab your tickets on Ev
 entbrite before they sell out. Your ticket purchase via Eventbrite guarant
 ees your spot on the dance floor!\n\nThere is no need to RSVP on meet-up i
 n order to attend! **This event is cross-posted\, open to the public and w
 ell attended.**\n\n**Questions:**\nContact Eva Murray: [919-926-8095](http
 ://tel:9199268095) \\| info@CapitalSquares\\.org\nVisit [https://CapitalSq
 uares.org/learn](https://capitalsquares.org/learn)\nCheck us out on [Faceb
 ook](https://www.facebook.com/capitalsquares) or [Instagram](https://www.i
 nstagram.com/capital_squares_raleigh/)
